   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> FAQ </h1>",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Frequently asked questions</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c233089",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Which pallet systems are supported?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »roboMark« automation solution is designed to be flexible and can be operated with different pallet systems.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c233092",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Do existing systems need to be adjusted?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>No. »roboMark« is designed to insert itself into existing manufacturing environments. In many cases, existing systems can continue to be used while tool data is automatically provided and processed. This keeps the integration effort low, and existing processes can continue to run largely unchanged.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c233094",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Is it possible to trace the tools?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, if questions arise regarding tools or if quality documentation is needed, the relevant information is readily available. Thanks to permanent labeling and automatic documentation, tools can be uniquely identified and assigned. This saves time when searching for data and ensures greater safety in production.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c233096",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What happens if the tool has internal cooling?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Tools with internal cooling can be labeled with »roboMark« without any problems. Laser labeling is applied to the circumference of the shank and does not affect the function of the cooling channels. The labeling position is selected to ensure safe and permanent labeling while maintaining unobstructed tool functionality.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c233098",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can Weldon tools be labeled?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, »roboMark« can also label Weldon tools. A specialized prompt during the process takes the Weldon area into account and ensures that the labeling is applied outside the clamping area. This preserves the full function of the tool holder.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c233100",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c233090",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
